== Trivia ==
* This item is a reference to the [[mario:Super Leaf|Super Leaf]] from ''Super Mario Bros. 3'', which grants the player the [[mario:Tanooki Suit|Tanooki suit]]. The Tanooki Suit also has a tanooki tail and the ability to turn into a statue.
* {{dlc|r}} When paired with {{I|Midas' Touch}}, the statue gains a golden tint.

